			"Message": "fix(Output): Add retry logic to user extension scan path\n\nThe system extension scan path had retry logic but user extension scan\ndid not. Without retry on the user path, an empty initial response\nsilently passes 0 user extensions through to viewsExtensionPoint and\nExtensionsRegistry, which means every user-extension contribution\n(gitlens panes, clangd views, commands, configuration, languages)\nstays unregistered for the rest of the session.\n\nAdd the same retry logic to `extensions:scanUserExtensions` as already\nexists for `extensions:scanSystemExtensions`. Also switch to exponential\nbackoff (100, 200, 400, 800, 1500ms) instead of fixed 1000ms delays,\nsince Mountain's scan usually completes in ~500ms and the longer delays\nwere just padding boot time.\n\nUser extensions now load properly at boot even if Mountain's async disk\nscan hasn't completed yet.",
			"SHA": "a28351b7240a5a722ebef039f3370ac90240818c"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2026-04-29T03:39:30Z",
			"File": [
